<title>FINLAND: TABLE-Finnish raw wood prices mixed in July - METLA.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Finnish raw wood prices mixed in July - METLA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish raw wood stumpage prices were mixed in July (weeks 28-31) with pine prices on the decline, spruce prices edging higher and birch prices unchanged or lower, the Finnish Forest Research Institute METLA said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It gave the following figures:</p>
<p>Pulpwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	  July '97   Jun '97  May '97  April '97  March '97</p>
<p> Pine     94.40     96.90    96.60	96.40	96.20</p>
<p> Spruce  130.50    130.20   130.60     128.80     127.40</p>
<p> Birch    93.40     93.40    94.40	94.40	94.50</p>
<p>Logwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	  July '97   Jun '97  May '97  April '97  March '97</p>
<p> Pine    265.30    266.90   266.90     264.60     255.10</p>
<p> Spruce  219.70    219.50   218.30     215.70     208.80</p>
<p> Birch   262.20    262.80   264.80     261.50     250.20</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245, news@reuter.fi</p>
</text>
